The native C/C++ shim and inherited material remain subject to Apache License
2.0. The complete Apache license text and third-party notices are in LICENSE.

This repository contains no Kotlin engine, TypeScript product, npm package, UI,
or application source. A separately distributed proprietary player is not
linked into this native WebAssembly binary.

The distributed browser artifacts include code from FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1-or-later),
dav1d (BSD-2-Clause), Emscripten, musl libc, Signalsmith Stretch (MIT), and
zlib. These components remain under their respective licenses.

The Maven `-sources.jar` includes the open shim, complete build recipe, and
the exact FFmpeg and dav1d source archives used for the matching Wasm binary.
The Emscripten image is pinned by version and multi-architecture digest. See
LGPL_RELINKING.md.
